# Keep the build context small and free of personal or generated files.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
private/
docs/
node_modules/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
src/ts/
# The plugin SDK: the interface modules of the shipped plugins are built in the image.
!src/ts/plugin-sdk/
# The exception above must not bring back the packages installed on the host.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
tests/
*.md
# Local configuration, secrets and data must never end up in the image.
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
